      <Docs>
        <summary>
          <para>Closes the tunnel connection, preventing it from being used to send HTTP requests.</para>
          <para>When a tunnel connection is closed, HttpEngine will interpret it as a failure to use the associated Proxy. HttpEngine will then try the next Proxy in the list passed to ProxyOptions (refer to that class documentation for more info).</para>
          <para><format type="text/html"><a href="https://developer.android.com/reference/android/net/http/Proxy.HttpConnectCallback#RESPONSE_ACTION_CLOSE" title="Reference documentation">Android reference for <code>android.net.http.Proxy.HttpConnectCallback.RESPONSE_ACTION_CLOSE</code>.</a></format></para>
